Section: utils
Description: configurable, fast, and thorough secrets scanner
 Betterleaks is a configurable, fast, and thorough secrets scanner. It is
 maintained by the folks who made Gitleaks, including the original author.
 .
 This package provides the CLI for secrets scanning and detection.
